      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a proposal for the city council to get some funding for the West End revitalization project. We need to convince the stakeholders that the district really needs this \"reinvigoration\" to attract new businesses and higher-end development. We've got some data on the area: it's mostly high-density apartment blocks, lots of small local bodegas, very diverse population with mostly working-class families, and some issues with street congestion and older infrastructure. Can you write a professional summary of the \"current character\" of the West End that highlights why the area is currently struggling and needs this upgrade to improve the city's overall image?",
